WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
{ED}

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:06.700
I believe it's time to give you a taste...

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.150
...of the splendors a Bad End can offer!

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.950
Guys, no!

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:24.440
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.270
Smile Precure!

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:27.170
Let's go!

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.710
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:29.840
All together!

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:31.440
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.640
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:36.310
Smile Precure!

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.150
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:46.590
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:51.800
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:57.740
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:02.670
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:02.640
So bright!

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:07.850
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:14.290
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.790
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:15.950
Let's go!

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.660
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:21.590
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:26.400
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:26.960
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:28.630
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:29.770
Everybody!

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.440
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.970
Fly to the future!

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:37.480
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.640
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.950
Smile Precure!

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:52.640
Give them back!

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:55.260
Oh, I think not.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:59.040
Besides, I think they'll find life in the Sloth Ball most pleasant.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:04.880
In here, the very concepts of worry, sadness and pain cease to exist.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:08.580
There's no need to lift a finger!

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:13.090
I'm certain they'll be quite at home in their new world.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.130
No, they won't-kuru!

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:17.230
I'll bring them back — I swear it!

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:19.640
And how might you accomplish that?

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.290
Send me in there too!

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:24.200
You're most welcome, of course.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:31.400
But know that you'll forget even your own existence, and become consumed by unrelenting apathy.

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:34.880
No, I won't! I won't let that happen!

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.420
Quite the fool we have here.

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:42.890
Miyuki-dono!

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:47.420
Hang in there...

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:02.180
<i>Mi-yu-ki!</i>

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:08.010
Huh...? Where am I...?

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.530
We're leavin'!

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:12.550
What about your club, Akane-chan?

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:13.550
Huh?

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.090
You have volleyball practice, right?

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:18.150
Volleyball? What're you on about?

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:22.590
Why bother with tiring stuff like that?

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:24.150
Hey, let's go to a theme park!

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:25.020
That does sound pleasant.

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:25.830
Yeah, let's go!

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:27.900
Come on, Miyuki!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.530
H-Hey, wait for me!

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:32.940
Guys!

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.670
Wait for me!

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:37.840
Umm, Miss?

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.480
My friends seem kind of different today.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.520
You're imagining it, Dear.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:44.280
Now, how about you go play with your friends?

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:46.150
But I'm sure...

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:48.280
You worry about things too much.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.620
Look, your friends are waiting for you.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.520
Miyuki!

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.420
Hurry up!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.360
Go on, Hoshizora-san.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:58.470
A-Alright! Bye, Miss!

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.320
<i>Something's not right...</i>

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:16.140
Wait, what?! How am I at the theme park?!

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.880
Where'd the school go?!

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.550
Miyuki!

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:22.420
Over here!

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:23.930
Guys...

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:33.570
Miyuki's in trouble-kuru... I've gotta go save her-kuru!

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:35.110
Candy, it's too dangerous-de gozaru!

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:37.930
I don't care! I want to help my friends-kuru!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:39.800
But...

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.310
Alright then.

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:48.600
The more the merrier!

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:52.280
Just know that you may not be so lucky this time.

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:56.040
I'll bring them back, I promise-kuru!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:01.640
What a stupid little fairy you are.

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:06.060
You can spend the rest of your life in this Sloth Ball with your Precure friends.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:11.580
It just wouldn't do if you were able to awaken the Royal Clock's powers, after all.

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:16.050
We can just eat all we want here!

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:17.670
And ride all the rides we want!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.870
And play all day, every day!

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:22.210
Or rest for as long as we desire.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.280
No school to worry about, no homework to do!

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.780
We don't have to do anything we don't want to!

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:29.420
See, look around ya. This is the life!

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:32.380
It does seem like everyone's having fun...

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:33.170
Here!

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:35.170
Try this, Miyuki-chan!

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.510
These are good too!

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:37.900
Eat as much as you wish!

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.030
No one's stoppin' ya!

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.130
Okay!

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.910
Mmm... this is really good! I'm so happy...

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:56.850
I feel like I don't have to care about anything anymore...

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:00.820
Kuru!

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:05.520
Kuru-

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:10.110
Ow...

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.260
Wow, you're so cute!

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:16.220
Are you a dog? A cat? Wait, a raccoon dog?

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:17.550
What's your name?

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:20.400
Have you forgotten about me, Miyuki-kuru?!

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:23.010
Ummm... who are you again?

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:24.960
How mean-kuru!

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:26.980
I know-kuru!

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:30.190
What're you doing?

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:31.390
Miyuki!

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.380
You've gotta remember-kuru!

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.880
A cookie...?

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:38.010
Things taste better when you share them with others-kuru!

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:44.060
Happiness is always better when it's shared! That's the secret to being ultra happy-kuru!

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:47.800
You were the one who taught me that, Miyuki!

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.370
I hate having to think about stuff like that...

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:54.340
Well you have to! No one else can tell you what matters most to you-kuru!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:56.800
What matters... most...?

00:06:56.800 --> 00:07:00.610
You need to think for yourself! Make your own decisions-kuru!

00:07:01.110 --> 00:07:02.580
My own...?

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:11.820
<i>You're right, Miyuki-kuru! Sharing made it yummier-kuru!</i>

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.920
<i>Yeah, this is dang good!</i>

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:16.890
<i>All the more for sharing in the moment together.</i>

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:22.520
<i>Happiness is always better when it's shared! That's the secret to being ultra happy!</i>

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:23.370
Kuru!

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.770
You remember-kuru?!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.680
I do!

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:36.380
I almost lost myself to it.

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:38.470
Guys, you've gotta snap out of it!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.260
This whole world's just an illusion Joker made!

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:43.350
Joker? Who the heck's that?

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.620
We fought him together, remember! As Precure!

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.390
Precure?

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.130
What're you on about?

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.930
Don't tell me you've forgotten about us being Precure...?

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:56.400
Come on, guys! You've gotta remember!

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:58.870
We've worked so hard together to get this far!

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:01.070
Hard work doesn't get you anywhere...

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.270
It's just an annoying waste of time...

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:08.480
And if all it's gonna do is wear ya out, what's the point of botherin'?

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:10.450
Stressing less is for the best!

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:12.410
No way...

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:15.850
Kinda hard to care about anything anymore...

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.790
I am starting to feel rather tired...

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.080
No! You can't let yourself fall asleep, not here!

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:22.530
Wake up!

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:23.830
Get a grip!

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:27.560
Akane-chan! Akane-chan! Please, open your eyes!

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.330
Do I... know ya...?

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.920
Akane-chan...

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.750
I know-kuru!

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:42.480
Miyuki, you've gotta purify this dimension with your Happy Shower-kuru!

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:46.120
Hey, good idea! That might just snap everyone out of it!

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.780
Hurry, Miyuki-kuru!

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.120
Right!

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:54.090
Ready?

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:57.480
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:58.540
Go!

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:00.700
Go, go!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.300
Let's go: Happy!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:29.270
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:32.460
Cure Happy!

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:38.170
Focus, focus, focus, focus!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:41.680
Precure...

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:45.160
Happy...

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:48.610
Shower!

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:52.750
I'm gonna bring you all back home, I swear!

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:57.050
You can do it, Happy-kuru!

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:06.700
Beauty!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:13.860
Happy!

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.080
Too bad~!

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.480
It's Joker-kuru!

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:29.230
I'm afraid I simply can't let you ruin my wonderful world here.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:31.460
But I can give you a friend to play with.

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:36.300
Fusing with those black noses is hardly good for one's health...

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:41.410
I think a yellow one should be quite enough for one measly Precure.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:44.020
Come forth, Akanbe!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.980
Akanbe!

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:57.520
What...?! What <i>is</i> this place?!

00:10:58.710 --> 00:10:59.520
Guys!

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:01.220
Wake up-kuru!

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.260
Akane-chan! Guys!

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:05.350
I think you should be more concerned with our mutual friend here.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:08.460
Akanbe!

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:10.210
If we fight here, they'll just get hurt...

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:12.460
Candy, keep them safe!

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:13.930
Akanbe!

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:20.770
Akanbe!

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:21.810
Akan!

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:23.780
Wake up-kuru!

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:26.780
Are you all awake now-kuru?

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:27.790
What's goin' on...?

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:30.990
Happy's fighting really hard to protect you-kuru!

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:32.000
Happy...?

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.150
Who's that?

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.500
Aka...?!

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.900
Oh my. Not bad, not bad at all.

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:47.670
But not enough!

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:48.770
Be!

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:53.090
Akanbe!

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:58.040
Happy...

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:02.480
What's she doin' that for...?

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:10.260
I won't lose to you! I still have to snap my friends out of this!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:13.490
Snap them out of it? What's the point?

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:16.130
Akanbe!

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:21.640
Life is so much better here! No school, no boring studying!

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:26.510
No need to get up early in the mornings! You can spend all day at the theme park, to boot!

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:35.750
I can't see what problem you could possibly have with my world!

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:42.450
My problem is that I prefer my friends how they normally are...

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:44.760
I want the friends I know back!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:49.910
Why be so selfish? They seem to be enjoying their life here!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.700
No, they're not! Not deep down, they aren't!

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:56.640
I've seen their real smiles, and they're nothing like those pathetic ones!

00:12:57.700 --> 00:13:02.170
You <i>do</i> say some silly things, don't you? Try being level-headed about this.

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:07.350
A life of disappointment, never seeing any return on the investment you put into it?

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:09.950
It hardly seems pleasant.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:14.450
No matter how hard you try, it never amounts to anything,

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:19.290
unless, of course, you include ridicule and depression.

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:26.400
You involve others in your goals, only to put all they've done to waste.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:29.400
What benefit could that possibly bring?

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:35.810
Your worries and doubts get in the way of your friends,

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:39.010
and they just loathe you for being the pathetic creature you are.

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:49.320
Whereas, if you were to simply not bother, you'd be spared both the effort and the consequences.

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:51.720
If you don't try, there's no risk of failure.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:56.900
Happy!

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.700
Not everything goes your way all the time-kuru!

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:06.370
But I love my friends the most when they're trying their hardest-kuru!

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:10.440
Because when they're really giving it their all...

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:12.650
...that's when they're at their best-kuru!

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.050
Miyuki!

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:19.750
Well, that was pathetic.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:30.000
When you beat us all that time in Märchenland, we realized something...

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:36.240
Through all that crying, worrying, and thinking about all that had happened...

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:39.040
We found out things about ourselves that we never knew!

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:43.010
We figured out what mattered to us more than anything in the world!

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:47.750
<i>I love Candy!</i>

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:53.480
<i>Just as much as I love my friends, and my family.</i>

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:56.350
<i>That's why we should stick together.</i>

00:14:56.350 --> 00:15:02.790
<i>That's all I need for my ultra-happy future!</i>

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:08.740
<i>Having friends isn't stupid at all!</i>

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:15.270
<i>Through the good times and the bad, they'll always be there for you!</i>

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:21.300
<i>We can all laugh together, and when we're feeling sad, we can cheer each other up!</i>

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:27.090
<i>With our friends at our side, nothing can hold us back!</i>

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:30.250
<i>That is the power they bestow!</i>

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:36.760
Finding the answers we needed wasn't easy! It was painful, and it was tough...

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:41.770
But through all the tears, we've persevered!

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:44.540
No matter how slow and painful it is, we want to keep pushing forward!

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:50.710
I may be just a klutz...

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:55.980
...but I want to face whatever the future brings with my friends by my side!

00:15:55.980 --> 00:16:01.320
Because together, I know that future will shine even brighter!

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:05.560
How ridiculous! I shall show you how foolish you truly are!

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:13.670
Shout all you want! Your pathetic pleas won't reach your friends now!

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:15.330
Akanbe!

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:27.470
It's time we put an end to this!

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:29.080
Akan...!

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:35.500
Candy!

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.860
Candy! Run!

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:42.330
I'm gonna fight with you-kuru! I'm scared, but I'm going nowhere-kuru!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.300
Then you can both die in one fell swoop!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:45.900
...be!

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:48.830
Candy, no!

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:52.230
Happy!

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:03.950
Sunny!

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.920
I heard you two loud and clear!

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.050
What?! Get them, Akanbe!

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:16.560
Peace!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.270
I heard you too!

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:22.720
Akan?!

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:23.870
Akanbe!

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:29.680
March! Beauty!

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:32.180
I apologize for my tardiness.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:34.910
Time to show him what we can do!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:36.680
Guys...

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:39.890
This is utterly inconceivable! How could they all have just reverted?!

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:44.500
You've got one thing right. Sometimes ya do need a bit of a break from life.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.520
But ya know what?

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:49.660
You can't just give up on it forever! You'll never get anywhere that way!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:55.700
No matter how hard it gets, we'll keep pressing forward, one step at a time!

00:17:56.190 --> 00:18:02.340
And if life throws us obstacles we cannot surmount alone, our friends will be the key to our progress!

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:07.210
Because we believe that you can only truly smile once you've tried your hardest!

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:12.720
That's why I'll fight with my friends-kuru, and together, I know we'll all be happy-kuru!

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:14.890
So let's shine bright!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:19.500
Smile Precure!

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:22.560
What?!

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:27.200
This light... could it be...?!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.810
My fellows, you've returned!

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:45.350
What does this mean? How did they break out of my Sloth Ball?

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:48.790
But that is not the pertinent matter. Stopping them is!

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:53.020
Akan...

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:57.730
Hyper Akanbe!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:59.200
Come on, guys!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.660
Right!

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:07.770
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:24.390
Princess Happy!

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:26.590
Princess Sunny!

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:28.790
Princess Peace!

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:31.000
Princess March!

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:33.200
Princess Beauty!

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:41.510
Precure: Princess Form!

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:49.830
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:53.720
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:09.810
May the light of hope shine!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:13.510
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:20.410
Precure...

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:24.120
Royal Rainbow...

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.890
Burst!

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:34.750
Akanbe...!

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:43.740
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:56.820
This is all thanks to you guys-kuru!

00:20:57.250 --> 00:21:02.790
The black nose failed? Don't tell me the power of the Royal Clock is being unleashed!

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:06.030
I'll need to double my efforts to find the Miracle Jewel.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:13.230
I believe that was the legendary bird of fire, the Phoenix.

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:19.540
With your six hearts now in perfect unison, you and Candy have given rise to the Precure's ultimate power.

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:26.810
I believe the next time we fill the Décor Decor, the Royal Queen will finally return to us!

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:32.050
It's been one long day, huh?

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:36.510
And I bet it's not gonna get any easier...

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:46.990
...but I know that if we stick together, we'll be able to face whatever they throw at us...

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:40.840
There you are, foul demons!

00:23:40.840 --> 00:23:44.990
I shall punish you for your countless acts of violence against my people-de gozaru!

00:23:44.990 --> 00:23:47.630
Märchen Sword Skill, Fairy Slash!

00:23:47.630 --> 00:23:49.780
Uhh, excuse me, but... who are you, exactly?

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:53.280
People call me Pop the Wanderer. Though my name is of little importance.

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:54.910
Wait, Pop?!

00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:56.610
Then why'd you tell us?!

00:23:57.120 --> 00:23:58.560
Smile Precure:

00:24:01.910 --> 00:24:04.200
Find your ultra happy smile!
